@startuml
title State machine model of a healthcare portal

[*] --> UnregisteredUserState

state UnregisteredUserState
UnregisteredUserState : do / display login screen

state RegisteringUserState
RegisteringUserState : do / register new user
RegisteringUserState : do / validate registration
RegisteringUserState : do / handle RegistrationFailureEvent
RegisteringUserState --> SignInFailedState : RegistrationFailureEvent
RegisteringUserState --> RegisteredUserState : NewUserRegistrationEvent

state RegisteredUserState
RegisteredUserState : do / display login screen
RegisteredUserState : do / authenticate user
RegisteredUserState : do / handle SessionEndEvent
RegisteredUserState --> SignedInUserState : successful authentication
RegisteredUserState --> SignInFailedState : failed authentication

state SignedInUserState
SignedInUserState : do / display available facilities
SignedInUserState : do / allow user to read news and expert content
SignedInUserState : do / handle UserSignInEvent
SignedInUserState --> NewsAndContentUserState : UserSignInEvent
SignedInUserState --> HealthInfoUserState : UserSignInEvent
SignedInUserState --> ResultViewedUserState : UserSignInEvent and ResultViewedEvent

state NewsAndContentUserState
NewsAndContentUserState : do / display news and expert content
NewsAndContentUserState : do / allow user to continue using the system or finish session
NewsAndContentUserState --> SignedInUserState : user action

state HealthInfoUserState
HealthInfoUserState : do / provide health-related information options
HealthInfoUserState : do / allow user to continue using the system or finish session
HealthInfoUserState --> ResultViewedUserState : result viewed

state ResultViewedUserState
ResultViewedUserState : do / display result
ResultViewedUserState : do / handle ResultViewedEvent
ResultViewedUserState --> PaymentUserState : ResultViewedEvent and CashPaymentEvent or InsurancePaymentEvent

state PaymentUserState
PaymentUserState : do / allow user to select payment methods (cash or insurance)
PaymentUserState : do / handle CashPaymentEvent
PaymentUserState : do / handle InsurancePaymentEvent
PaymentUserState : do / complete the payment process
PaymentUserState --> CashPaymentUserState : CashPaymentEvent
PaymentUserState --> InsurancePaymentUserState : InsurancePaymentEvent
PaymentUserState : do / handle FeedbackCollectionEvent
PaymentUserState --> LoggedOutState : successful payment

state CashPaymentUserState
CashPaymentUserState : do / inform user about cash payment details
CashPaymentUserState : do / complete the payment process
CashPaymentUserState --> LoggedOutState : successful cash payment

state InsurancePaymentUserState
InsurancePaymentUserState : do / check payment with insurance
InsurancePaymentUserState : do / complete the payment process
InsurancePaymentUserState --> LoggedOutState : successful insurance-based payment

state FeedbackCollectionState
FeedbackCollectionState : do / collect user feedback
FeedbackCollectionState : do / handle FeedbackCollectionEvent
FeedbackCollectionState --> SignedInUserState : user feedback collected

state SignInFailedState
SignInFailedState : do / display error message and return to UnregisteredUserState
SignInFailedState : do / handle SessionEndEvent
SignInFailedState --> LoggedOutState : SessionEndEvent

state LoggedOutState
LoggedOutState : do / log out user
LoggedOutState : do / return to UnregisteredUserState
LoggedOutState : do / handle FeedbackCollectionEvent
@enduml
